# Framework Jira status (overlay)

## Gate

Requires the **`atlassian`** marketplace plugin. If `project.env` has blank
`DEFAULT_JIRA_PROJECT` **and** this turn has no named issue key and no
explicit Jira create/manage ask, **ignore this rule**.

Portable lifecycle lives in `atlassian-jira-status`. This overlay adds host
specifics.

## Board id

Read `DEFAULT_JIRA_BOARD_ID` from `project.env` when set; never invent.

## Done bar (Stories / Bugs)

Mark `Done` only after every required PR is merged for **this framework remote
and any touched addon remotes** (see `framework-git-workflow`). An open PR is
not Done.

Tasks / Sub-tasks: deliverable complete (PR only if host requires).

## Scope labels

Keep `framework` / `addon` labels accurate when the tree changes mid-work.
